<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεπι-στρέφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn at the same time</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἀτράκτου τὴν περιφοράν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					617c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ομένου τοῦ ἄξονος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.9.27
			</span></i>; of one being massaged, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.177
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>help to make attentive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				14
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἑαυτοὺς τὸν ἀκροατήν</span>
			<i>turn towards them also</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.542c
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>twist together</i>
			like strands, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				84d
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἓν τέλος
				συνεπιστρέφεσθαι τοῖς ἤθεσιν</span>
			<i>to be intertwined</i> in their characters with a view to . . ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Comp.Lyc.Num.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>turn jointly towards</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀλλήλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Num.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
